5 tests\n+test installed_cli_rejects_state_instead_of_executing_statelessly ... ok\n+test installed_compiler_uses_embedded_target_constants ... ok\n+test installed_description_matches_machine_and_native_certificate_capabilities ... ok\n+test stateless_library_runner_rejects_state_marked_bundle ... ok\n+test installed_soft3_compiler_rejects_foreign_targets_and_resources ... ok\n+\n+test result: ok. 5 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.83s\n+\n+\n+running 58 tests\n+test formula::tests::atom_roundtrips ... ok\n+test formula::tests::cell_roundtrips ... ok\n+test formula::tests::empty_subject_is_zero ... ok\n+test formula::tests::leaves_flatten_left_to_right ... ok\n+test formula::tests::nary_cell_folds_right ... ok\n+test formula::tests::singleton_cell_errors ... ok\n+test formula::tests::subject_puts_last_input_at_head ... ok\n+test formula::tests::trailing_input_errors ... ok\n+test formula::tests::unclosed_bracket_errors ... ok\n+test formula::tests::whitespace_is_insignificant ... ok\n+test structured::tests::admission::exact_input_bounds_and_shared_code_input_charge_once ... ok\n+test structured::tests::admission::exact_art1_fields_and_terminator_are_enforced ... ok\n+test structured::tests::census::driver::frozen_compiler_prefix ... ignored, bounded actual ART1/JOB1 diagnostic; requires JOY_CENSUS_PROGRAM, INPUT, OUTPUT\n+test structured::tests::census::tests::capture_cap_failure_preserves_prefix_and_reports_no_success ... ok\n+test structured::tests::admission::worker_deadline_returns_failure_without_output_bytes ... ok\n+test structured::tests::census::tests::prefix_ceiling_stops_without_reporting_successful_cost ... ok\n+test structured::tests::census::tests::repeated_evaluations_count_occurrences_and_distinct_keys_separately ... ok\n+test structured::tests::census::tests::observed_loop_includes_compose_and_branch_continuations ... ok\n+test structured::tests::census::tests::sink_rejects_conflicting_retained_header_without_p