ssed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.00s\n+\n+\n+running 2 tests\n+test exact_final4_imported_loop_indices_have_public_proofs ... ok\n+test loop_index_constants_do_not_escape_shadowed_or_returning_frames ... ok\n+\n+test result: ok. 2 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.16s\n+\n+\n+running 5 tests\n+test explicit_budget_and_expected_claim_are_enforced_without_secret_replay ... ok\n+test every_public_statement_and_build_identity_is_bound ... ok\n+test malformed_outer_metadata_and_inner_wire_fail_at_their_boundaries ... ok\n+test native_profiles_select_correctly_and_private_proofs_use_fresh_randomness ... ok\n+test hidden_namespace_uses_authenticated_tables_and_canonical_certificate_metadata ... ok\n+\n+test result: ok. 5 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 1.43s\n+\n+\n+running 2 tests\n+test private_loop_return_proves_and_skips_later_witness ... ok\n+test bounded_loop_return_proof_binds_selected_result_input_and_cost ... ok\n+\n+test result: ok. 2 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 1.52s\n+\n+\n+running 5 tests\n+test artifact_format_and_claim_filters_are_exact ... ok\n+test explicit_public_budget_controls_native_confirmation ... ok\n+test prover_and_verifier_traits_bind_claim_without_legacy_downgrade ... ok\n+test unsupported_secret_state_and_call_inputs_are_refused ... ok\n+test compiled_source_roundtrip_and_changed_statement_rejection ... ok\n+\n+test result: ok. 5 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.01s\n+\n+\n+running 5 tests\n+test dynamic_self_application_hits_the_native_depth_guard ... ok\n+test binary_and_nary_formulas_share_the_noun_depth_ceiling ... ok\n+test malformed_raw_formula_returns_an_error_without_process_abort ... ok\n+test shared_result_expansion_is_checked_before_flat_output_allocation ... ok\n+test hash_consing_does_not_bypass_the_syntactic_node_ceiling ... ok\n+\n+test result: